Paste a customer message.
Set the date the message was sent.

3
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:34,000
6 choco chip cookies + 4 brownies = INR 750.
Check quantities, date, time and pickup method.

4
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:45,000
A box has no assumed size.
Review missing quantities and customer details.

5
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Track orders through New, Baking, Ready and Completed.
These are fictional examples.

6
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:10,000
The kitchen list combines quantities across active orders.
Ready items are excluded from the to-bake count.

7
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Review and copy a confirmation draft.
Export orders or download a backup.

8
